request.description:
Returns the authenticated user's RBAC permissions and role for the current tenant.

Requires Bearer token. Use for frontend UI gating — backend routes still enforce permissions via `PermissionsGuard`.

**Response shape:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "permissions": ["lead.read", "lead.update"],
    "role": { "id": "...", "name": "Agent" }
  }
}
```

